{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想為孩子找一本既有趣又能培養閱讀興趣的互動書嗎？《Funny Kids Poems》是一款專為 6 歲以下幼兒設計的互動詩歌書，結合短小押韻的詩句與色彩鮮豔的動畫，讓小朋友透過點擊與觸摸探索故事，現在正進行限時免費，原價 US $2.99 可免費下載。</p>\n\n<h2>趣味互動</h2>\n<p>這款 App 包含 12 頁由 Marina Lindholm 創作的精美插畫與動畫，每一頁都會對觸碰產生反應，點擊畫面上的元素即可讓角色動起來，將閱讀變成好玩的遊戲。另外，App 支援英文與其他語言，只需點擊主畫面左上角的旗幟就能切換語言，方便孩子學習基礎詞彙。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2688x1242bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2688x1242bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2688x1242bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2688x1242bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2732x2048bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2732x2048bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Funny Kids Poems</li>\n<li>應用類別：Book</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T14:59:38.879544+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}